TI  - MVVM in the Era of Modern Android: A Systematic Literature Review and Taxonomy of Architectural Trade-offs
PY  - 2026
T2  - CLEI Eletronic Journal (CLEIej)
VL  - 29
IS  - 2
SP  - 1
