AB  - Based on vibration and sound sensors in Android or IOS smart phones, an elevator fault diagnosis cloud system is proposed and designed. This system can monitoring the vibration and noise signals of the elevators based on smart phones, and evaluate the fault/normal conditions of them. In this system, the authors propose a cloud system scheme of fault diagnosis for elevators in cities based on the vibration and sound monitoring and the deep learning methods. In this paper, the software architecture and the software requirements of this cloud system are designed and analyzed in detail. And then the experiment of data acquirement for vibration and sound of elevators is implemented by the authors. This experiment analysis could be a basis of fault diagnosis or health evaluation algorithm development for elevators based on the cloud system. © 2019 IEEE.
